---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/ai-mortgage-admin/styles.css';
import '../styles/ai-mortgage-admin/sections.css';
import '../styles/ai-mortgage-admin/motion.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Charlie Driving School Admin — More pupils passing. Less time lost to admin."
  description="Drop in the pupil. Charlie Driving School Admin reads the progress, drafts the lesson plan and chases the pupil for whatever's missing."
  ogTitle="Charlie Driving School Admin — More pupils passing. Less time lost to admin."
  ogDescription="Drop in the pupil. Charlie Driving School Admin reads the progress, drafts the lesson plan and chases the pupil for whatever's missing."
  includeHomeStyles={false}
>

<style is:global>
  /* Charlie accent — yellow. L-plate / DVSA palette. Dark ink for contrast. */
  :root {
    --lime: #FACC15;
    --lime-2: #CA8A04;
    --lime-ink: #1F1500;
    --lime-rgb: 250, 204, 21;
  }
</style>

<div class="scroll-progress"></div>
<a class="float-cta" href="#book"><span class="dot"></span>Book a call<span class="arrow">→</span></a>

<header class="wrap">
  <nav class="nav">
    <a class="nav-brand" href="#">
      <img src="/images/the-claws-logo.svg" alt="TheClaws" class="nav-brand-logo" />
      <span>Charlie Driving School Admin</span>
    </a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#problem">Problem</a>
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#case">Case study</a>
      <a href="#incl">Included</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" href="#book">Book a call <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
  </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero wrap">
  <div class="hero-left">
    <div class="eyebrow reveal"><span class="dot"></span>Lessons booked while you're behind the wheel</div>
    <h1 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">More pupils passing.<br><span class="mark">Less time lost to admin.</span></h1>
    <p class="sub reveal reveal-delay-2">Drop in the pupil. Charlie Driving School Admin reads the progress, drafts the lesson plan and chases the pupil for whatever's missing.</p>
    <div class="btns reveal reveal-delay-3">
      <a class="btn btn-lime btn-magnet" href="#book">Book a call &amp; see it on your pupils <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#how">See how it works</a>
    </div>
    <p class="micro reveal reveal-delay-4">We'll review one live pupil on the call and show what it would have planned — bring the file, no prep needed.</p>

    <hr class="hero-divider reveal reveal-delay-4">

    <div class="hero-caps reveal reveal-delay-5">
      <div class="hero-cap">
        <span class="ic">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="8" y1="13" x2="16" y2="13"></line><line x1="8" y1="17" x2="16" y2="17"></line></svg>
        </span>
        <strong>Reads the whole pupil file</strong>
        <span>Provisional, theory pass, manoeuvre history, mock test scores, lesson notes.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cap">
        <span class="ic">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <strong>Drafts the chase</strong>
        <span>Written from the actual progress. You review before sending.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cap">
        <span class="ic">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <strong>Fits your school's process</strong>
        <span>Your block pricing, your DVSA wording, your cancellation policy, your tone.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-stage">
    <img class="agent" src="/images/account-manager.webp" alt="Charlie Driving School Admin reviewing a pupil">
    <div class="sbubble"><span class="spark"></span> What needs attention on pupil #DRV-2847?</div>

    <div class="fcard fcard-alert">
      <div class="fc-head">
        <span class="ic">!</span>
        <span>Missing items flagged</span>
        <span class="pill">4</span>
      </div>
      <div class="chip-list">
        <div class="chip-item"><svg class="chip-ic" width="11" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg><span><b>Provisional licence</b> · photo</span></div>
        <div class="chip-item"><svg class="chip-ic" width="11" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg><span><b>Block 3 payment</b> · 10 lessons</span></div>
        <div class="chip-item"><svg class="chip-ic" width="11" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg><span><b>Theory pass cert</b> · scan</span></div>
        <div class="chip-item"><svg class="chip-ic" width="11" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg><span><b>Eyesight check</b> · 20m plate</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="fcard fcard-todo">
      <div class="fc-head">
        <span class="ic">✓</span>
        <span>Todo List</span>
        <span class="pill lime">2 ITEMS</span>
      </div>
      <div class="todo-i">
        <div class="ti-head">📅 Test booking<span class="ti-pill">Confirmed</span></div>
        <div class="ti-sub">Practical test — Loughborough centre, 4 weeks out</div>
      </div>
      <div class="todo-i">
        <div class="ti-head">📋 Lesson plan<span class="ti-pill out">Reviewed</span></div>
        <div class="ti-sub">2 mocks + dual carriageway focus before test</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="fcard fcard-wa">
      <div class="fc-head">
        <span class="ic ic-wa" aria-label="WhatsApp">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.297-.497.1-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span>WhatsApp chase</span>
        <span class="pill">Draft</span>
      </div>
      <div class="wa-msg">Hi Sam, smashing progress on roundabouts last week! To get you booked for your practical and lock in block 3, could you send a photo of your provisional, your theory pass certificate, and ping the £350 block payment via the link?</div>
      <div class="wa-meta">
        <span>To: Sam</span>
        <span class="send">Review &amp; send →</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="ticker-band">
  <div class="ticker">
    <span class="t-strong">What would you do with 6 extra paid lessons a week?</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
    <span>Because that's what the pupil admin is costing you.</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
    <span class="t-strong">Future instructors don't pay it anymore</span>
    <span class="t-sep">—</span>
    <span>they teach what their AI already booked.</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
    <span class="t-strong">What would you do with 6 extra paid lessons a week?</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
    <span>Because that's what the pupil admin is costing you.</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
    <span class="t-strong">Future instructors don't pay it anymore</span>
    <span class="t-sep">—</span>
    <span>they teach what their AI already booked.</span>
    <span class="t-sep">·</span>
  </div>
</div>

<section id="problem" class="real bg-grid bg-grid-dark">
  <div class="wrap real-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="sec-label">The problem</div>
      <h2>Your teaching is not the bottleneck. <em>Pupil admin</em> is.</h2>
      <p>You already know how to teach. What slows you down is everything around it: replying to enquiries between lessons, chasing block payments, sorting test bookings, recovering no-shows, tracking progress, and reminding pupils about theory and eyesight checks.</p>
      <div class="problem-cards">
        <div class="pcard">
          <span class="pcard-k">01 / Enquiries</span>
          <h4>Slow replies</h4>
          <p>Pupils book whoever replies first, not whoever's best.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pcard pcard-dark">
          <span class="pcard-k">02 / No-shows</span>
          <h4>Empty hours</h4>
          <p>Forgotten lessons, late cancellations, last-minute reschedules.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pcard">
          <span class="pcard-k">03 / Tests</span>
          <h4>DVSA bookings</h4>
          <p>Practical, theory, retests, mock test prep, eyesight checks.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pcard pcard-lime">
          <span class="pcard-k">04 / Pupil work</span>
          <h4>Pupil chase</h4>
          <p>Draft WhatsApps, block payment chases, parent updates.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="real-col">
      <div class="transcript reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="sec-label">The real problem</div>

        <div class="transcript-stage">
          <img class="transcript-photo" src="/images/the-real-problem.png" alt="An exhausted driving instructor at the end of a long day" />

          <div class="stage-overlay">
            <div class="stage-quote-wrap">
              <blockquote class="stage-quote">
                I'm in the car all day — but <span class="hl">my evenings are admin</span>, not lessons.
              </blockquote>
              <div class="sig stage-sig">— Instructor using Charlie Driving School Admin</div>
            </div>

            <div class="notes-wall" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="note note-1">
                <span class="note-tape"></span>
                <p>"3 enquiries on Facebook this week. Got back to one. Lost two."</p>
                <span class="note-attr">— ADI, Birmingham</span>
              </div>
              <div class="note note-2 note-lime">
                <span class="note-tape"></span>
                <p>"Pupil no-showed at 6am. Cancellation policy never got sent. £40 lost."</p>
                <span class="note-attr">— Driving school owner, Bristol</span>
              </div>
              <div class="note note-3">
                <span class="note-tape"></span>
                <p>"Block payment chase at 11pm. Test booking deadline tomorrow."</p>
                <span class="note-attr">— ADI, Manchester</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="body-txt">
          The admin around each pupil sets the cap. <strong>More pupils means more enquiries to reply</strong>, more block payments to chase, more test bookings to track, more parents to update. So the instructor either takes fewer pupils, or takes them and pays for it with evenings on WhatsApp.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="fixes">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="fixes-head reveal">
      <div class="sec-label fixes-eyebrow">
        <svg class="sl-ic" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.29 3.86 1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0Z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg>
        Why the usual fixes do not work
      </div>
      <h2>Hiring an office assistant takes months. Templates <em>do not read the progress</em>. Generic AI does not know a manoeuvre score from a hazard perception fail.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="fix-row reveal reveal-delay-2">
      <div class="fix-card fc-fail">
        <span class="fc-badge fc-x" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h4>An office assistant</h4>
        <p>Costs more than your hourly rate. Needs training on your block prices, your cancellation policy and your tone. Most ADIs work alone — you don't want a team, you want help.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fix-card fc-fail">
        <span class="fc-badge fc-x" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h4>Booking apps with templates</h4>
        <p>Generic "remember your lesson tomorrow" SMS. They don't read the progress, don't catch a missing payment, and pupils ignore them or no-show anyway.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fix-card fc-fail">
        <span class="fc-badge fc-x" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h4>Generic AI chatbots</h4>
        <p>Wait for you to explain the pupil from scratch every time. They don't understand block pricing, mock test scoring, hazard perception, or why a pupil failing on roundabouts needs a different lesson plan.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="fits-box reveal reveal-delay-3">
      <span class="fits-pill">
        <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
        How it fits
      </span>
      <div class="fits-body">
        <h3>A reading and drafting layer. You stay the instructor in the car.</h3>
        <div class="fits-body-copy">
          <p>Every reply, every WhatsApp, every chase is reviewed by you before anything moves. Charlie Driving School Admin does not book lessons, take payment, or commit you to slots.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fix-row fix-row-win">
        <div class="fix-card fc-win">
          <span class="fc-badge fc-check" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><polyline points="9 12 11 14 15 10"/></svg>
          </span>
          <h4>You decide what goes out</h4>
          <p>It drafts, plans, and asks. It does not commit a slot or take payment without you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fix-card fc-win">
          <span class="fc-badge fc-check" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </span>
          <h4>Built for driving schools</h4>
          <p>Provisionals, theory passes, manoeuvres, mock tests, DVSA bookings. Reads the pupil progress sheet. Not generic SMS.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fix-card fc-win">
          <span class="fc-badge fc-check" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="fc-ic" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="9" y1="13" x2="15" y2="13"/><line x1="9" y1="17" x2="13" y2="17"/></svg>
          </span>
          <h4>Fits your school's process</h4>
          <p>Your block pricing, your cancellation policy, your DVSA wording, your tone. Configured at setup.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="how" class="how bg-grid">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-label reveal">How it works</div>
    <h2 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">Four steps from new pupil to <em>passed first time.</em></h2>

    <div class="how-flow">
      <div class="hstep reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <span class="hs-eyebrow">Step one</span>
        <h3>Drop in the pupil</h3>
        <div class="hs-visual">
          <div class="doc-mock">
            <span class="doc-line w70"></span>
            <span class="doc-line w50"></span>
            <span class="doc-line w65"></span>
            <span class="doc-block"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>Provisional licence, theory status, lesson notes, mock test scores, target test date.</p>
        <span class="hs-tag">Drop the file</span>
      </div>

      <div class="hs-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </div>

      <div class="hstep reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <span class="hs-eyebrow">Step two</span>
        <h3>Charlie Driving School Admin reviews</h3>
        <div class="hs-visual">
          <div class="review-mock">
            <div class="rm-card-back"></div>
            <div class="rm-card">
              <span class="rm-head"></span>
              <span class="rm-line w60"></span>
              <span class="rm-line w45"></span>
              <span class="rm-reply" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="15 10 20 15 15 20"/><path d="M4 4v7a4 4 0 0 0 4 4h12"/></svg>
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>Reads the progress, flags weak manoeuvres, drafts the lesson plan and the next-block prompt.</p>
        <span class="hs-tag">Full review</span>
      </div>

      <div class="hs-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </div>

      <div class="hstep reveal reveal-delay-4">
        <span class="hs-eyebrow">Step three</span>
        <h3>You get drafts &amp; flags</h3>
        <div class="hs-visual">
          <div class="chips-mock">
            <span class="cm-chip cm-1">Lesson plan</span>
            <span class="cm-chip cm-2">Block due</span>
            <span class="cm-chip cm-3">Mock test prompt</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>Review the lesson plan, approve the WhatsApp chase, decide what goes to the pupil (or parent).</p>
        <span class="hs-tag">Tap, send, done</span>
      </div>

      <div class="hs-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </div>

